UPDATE companies SET description='HBI Textiles Manufacturing was founded in 1990 in St. Paul, Minnesota, as a family-owned, American-made business. The company began as a contract cut-and-sew operation and has since expanded into leather goods, product development, fulfillment, and marketing services.

The company operates a satellite network of contract sewing described as one of the largest in the country, supplemented by a home-sewing program that provides workforce flexibility. Its artisans are certified on each product they produce, and the firm emphasizes a quality assurance program that stands behind all workmanship. Services span idea generation, design, prototyping, cut-and-sew manufacturing, custom packaging with screen printing, heat transfer, and embroidery, third-party logistics integrated with major e-commerce platforms, sourcing from tanneries and mills, and creative marketing focused on American-made narratives. The facility is referred to as "the barn" in client testimonials.

HBI serves a national client base ranging from large established brands to small specialty shops and startups across industries including consumer goods, healthcare, travel, sports, outdoors, grooming, fashion, pet, hospitality, and restaurant sectors.

The company''s stated mission is to cultivate a sustainable economy through domestic supply chains, local collaborations, and community support. HBI has received the SBA Home-Based Business Advocate of the Year award and the Family Celebration Award from six Minnesota non-profits for its commitment to families.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Cut and sew manufacturing", "Leather goods manufacturing", "Product development (design, prototyping)", "Fulfillment services (3PL for B2B/B2C, e-commerce integration)", "Product presentation (custom packaging, screen printing, heat transfer, embroidery)", "Sourcing & procurement (tanneries, mills)", "Marketing services (creative design, campaign development)", "Home sewing program", "Satellite contract sewing network", "Quality assurance program"], "industries": ["Consumer goods", "Healthcare", "Travel", "Sports", "Outdoors", "Grooming", "Fashion", "Pet", "Hospitality", "Restaurant"], "materials": ["Leather", "Textiles"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded 1990, family-owned, American-made, St. Paul, Minnesota -> db", "Contract cut and sew manufacturer with leather goods experience -> /", "Satellite network of contract sewing one of largest in country -> /about", "Home sewing program for worker flexibility -> /about", "Artisans certified on every product, quality assurance program -> /about", "Services: product development, fulfillment, contract manufacturing, product presentation, sourcing, marketing -> /", "Industries served: consumer goods, healthcare, travel, sports, outdoors, grooming, fashion, pet, hospitality, restaurant -> /", "Mission: cultivate sustainable economy through domestic supply chains, local collaborations, community support -> /", "Core values listed -> /about", "Awards: SBA Home-Based Business Advocate of the Year, Family Celebration Award -> /about", "Facility referred to as ''the barn'' -> /"], "company_