UPDATE companies SET description='HRS Sheet Metal operates from Orlando, Florida, serving the Central Florida region including Tampa. The family‑owned shop was founded in 2022, emerging from a name change of the long‑standing J&R Conlon Sheet Metal. The transition preserved the same in‑house craftsmanship and commitment to custom fabrication that the predecessor had built over decades.

The company provides custom sheet metal fabrication, roofing system packages, and specialty metal products. Its capabilities include handmade fabrication, custom brake forming, commercial box gutter and downspout production, color matching, coping systems, custom chimney caps, and standing‑seam or exposed‑fastener roof panels. All work is performed in a centrally located facility that offers both pickup and delivery, with bilingual staff available to assist customers.

Primary customers are builders, developers, and contractors across Central Florida, covering both commercial and residential projects. The shop supplies architectural sheet metal components such as flashing, leaderheads, collection boxes, scuppers, and full metal roofing packages backed by manufacturer warranties.

HRS Sheet Metal emphasizes its 100‑plus years of combined team experience, emergency service availability, and free estimates delivered within 24‑48 hours. The business was started to bring tailored, handcrafted metal solutions to the local construction community with a focus on precision, quick turnaround, and approachable pricing.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom sheet metal fabrication", "Handmade fabrication", "Custom brake metal fabrication", "Commercial box gutter fabrication", "Downspout fabrication", "Color matching", "Commercial sheet metal fabrication", "Custom roofing", "Coping supplier services", "Roofing system packages", "Specialty metal products", "Custom soldering work", "Emergency services", "Free estimates", "Pickup and delivery", "Architectural sheet metal components", "Coping systems", "Custom chimney caps", "Standing seam roof panel systems", "Exposed fastener metal roof panels", "Flashing components", "Leaderheads for drainage systems", "Collection boxes for drainage systems", "Scuppers"], "industries": ["Construction", "Commercial roofing", "Residential roofing", "Architectural metalwork"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "2-3 weeks for most projects", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["100+ years of combined team experience", "Emergency services available when schedule permits", "Free estimates within 24\u201148 hours", "All fabrication performed in\u2011house with handmade attention", "Bilingual staff (English/Spanish)"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2022 -> /about", "Family-owned business -> /", "100+ years combined experience -> /", "Located in Orlando, FL -> /", "Serves Tampa, FL -> /", "Custom sheet metal fabrication services -> /", "Roofing system packages -> /", "Specialty metal products -> /", "Handmade fabrication -> /", "Emergency services available -> /", "Free estimates within 24-48 hours -> /", "Bilingual staff (English/Spanish) -> /about", "In-house fabrication -> /", "