UPDATE companies SET description='Hana Technologies, Inc. was founded in 1999 in Solon, Ohio, as a member of the Hana Microelectronics Group, a family-owned enterprise that traces its roots to 1978 when Hana Microelectronics Public Co., Ltd. was established in Thailand. The group became a public company in 1993 and now operates a global network of manufacturing facilities across Thailand, China, the United States, Cambodia, and Korea.

