UPDATE companies SET description='High Peak Fabrication operates from Colorado Springs, Colorado, providing precision sheet metal fabrication services.

The shop specializes in laser cutting and press brake bending of stainless steel, carbon steel, and aluminum in thicknesses ranging from thin gauge to medium plate. In-house capabilities extend to TIG and MIG welding, PEM fastener insertion, tapping, and a range of finishing services including powder coating, sandblasting, zinc plating, and anodizing. The company handles prototypes as well as small and large production volumes, and offers assembly, packaging, and domestic or international shipping configured to Australian standards.

High Peak serves customers in transportation, manufacturing, electronics, construction, and machinery, with a noted focus on stainless steel design and installation for the food industry. Client testimonials reference work for Integrity Welding and Fabrication, ConcealFab, and Biac Broadband, the latter noting hundreds of products shipped worldwide since 2018.

The company emphasizes quality, reliability, and fast turnaround, backed by ISO 9001:2015 certification. It differentiates itself through design-for-manufacturability feedback, rapid prototyping, and a willingness to flag problematic features early in the design phase. Employees'' experience and pride are cited as key to meeting tight tolerances and delivering components that match drawings.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Laser cutting (stainless steel, carbon steel, aluminum)", "Press brake bending", "TIG welding (carbon steel, stainless steel, aluminum)", "MIG welding (carbon steel, stainless steel, aluminum)", "PEM fastener insertion (nuts and studs)", "Tapping", "Powder coating", "Sandblasting", "Zinc plating", "Anodizing (multiple colors)", "Assembly", "Packaging", "Domestic and international shipping", "Prototyping", "Stainless steel design and installation for food industry", "Design for manufacturability consultation"], "industries": ["Transportation", "Manufacturing", "Electronics", "Construction", "Machinery", "Food industry"], "materials": ["Stainless steel", "Carbon steel", "Aluminum"], "equipment": ["Laser cutting systems", "Press brakes"], "volume": "Prototypes, small and large volume", "lead_time": "Fast turnaround (not specified)", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["ISO 9001:2015 certified quality system", "Quick-turn prototyping and design-for-manufacturability review", "Domestic and foreign shipping to Australian standards", "In-house finishing: powder coating, sandblasting, plating, anodizing", "Employee experience and pride in meeting tight tolerances"], "facts_used": ["Location: Colorado Springs, Colorado -> db", "Specializes in stainless steel, carbon steel, aluminum sheet metal fabrication -> db", "Processes: laser cutting, press brake bending, TIG/MIG welding, PEM fastener insertion, tapping -> page /", "Finishing: powder coating, sandblasting, zinc plating, anodizing -> page /", "Certification: ISO 