UPDATE companies SET description='Hitachi Computer Products of America Inc. began operations in 1987 in Norman, Oklahoma, when it shipped the first products manufactured at its new North American facility. The original 78,000-square-foot building housed a printed circuit board assembly and test line along with a Class 1000 clean room, establishing a base for electronics production in the region.

With 35 years of manufacturing and logistics experience, the facility offers scalable process solutions designed to reduce complexity and improve efficiency across the supply chain. Product management and supply planning teams support these operations with advanced planning tools.

Hitachi ISCC states its mission is to be the "factory of choice" by exceeding targets for quality, speed, and customer service to deliver the lowest total cost. The operation emphasizes environmental sustainability — targeting a decarbonized, resource-efficient society — and frames diversity as a wellspring of innovation. Its strategic position in central Oklahoma is cited as a logistical advantage for national distribution.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Printed circuit board assembly", "PCB test", "Class 1000 clean room manufacturing", "Supply chain solutions", "Product management", "Supply planning"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Printed circuit board assembly and test line", "Class 1000 clean room"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["\"Factory of choice\" mission targeting quality, speed, service, and lowest total cost", "35 years of world-class manufacturing and logistics experience", "Scalable process solutions that reduce complexity and improve efficiencies", "Strategic location in Norman, Oklahoma, within the NAFTA corridor", "Environmental vision pursuing decarbonization, resource efficiency, and harmony with nature"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1987 in Norman, Oklahoma -> db", "Original building 78,000 ft2 with PCB assembly/test line and Class 1000 clean room -> db", "35 years manufacturing and logistics experience -> page:/", "Scalable process solutions reducing complexity -> page:/", "Strategic location in NAFTA corridor -> page:/", "Mission: factory of choice exceeding quality, speed, service targets -> page:/", "Environmental vision: decarbonized, resource-efficient, harmonized society -> page:/", "Diversity as wellspring of innovation -> page:/", "Global supply chain solutions -> page:/", "LinkedIn: hitachi-vantara-manufacturing -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "shipped the first shipment of products manufactured in North Ame