n-plastics-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='ICA Mid-Atlantic, located in Whitsett, North Carolina, traces its roots to 1988 when the facility was founded as Cable Assembly, LLC. Now a member of the ICA family of companies under ICA Holdings, the operation specializes in wire harness, cable assembly, and electromechanical manufacturing.

The company produces specialty wire harnesses, cable assemblies, and electromechanical assemblies using processes that include manufacturing engineering, electrical and mechanical engineering, CAD and 3D modeling, harness design software, automated CST machines, semi-automated assembly, hot stamp and ink-jet printing, ultrasonic splicing, ribbon cable notching and terminating, cable testing, and high-voltage testing.

ICA Mid-Atlantic serves customers in specialty vehicles, steam turbines, HVAC equipment, fuel dispensers, point-of-sale systems, wheelchair-accessible vehicles, material handling equipment, generators and compressors, energy management control, airline ground support equipment, and general industrial markets. Its client base includes Fortune 500 companies and multibillion-dollar international manufacturers.

The company emphasizes superior front-end support from design through delivery, an optimal balance of high quality and low cost designed into each product, state-of-the-art equipment, and a highly trained labor force to meet high-mix, low- and high-volume needs.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','AS9100','ISO 13485','ISO 14001','ITAR','RoHS']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wire harness manufacturing", "Cable assembly manufacturing", "Electromechanical assembly", "Manufacturing engineering", "Electrical engineering", "Mechanical engineering", "CAD design", "3D modeling", "Harness design software", "Automated CST machining", "Semi-automated assembly", "Hot stamp printing", "Ink-jet printing", "Ultrasonic splicing", "Ribbon cable notching and terminating", "Cable testing", "High voltage testing", "High-flex cable and chain assemblies", "Braiding and protective coverings", "First article production", "Production runs", "Materials planning", "Conveyor assembly"], "industries": ["Specialty Vehicles", "Steam Turbines", "HVAC Equipment", "Fuel Dispensers", "Point of Sale", "Wheelchair-Accessible Vehicles", "Material Handling Equipment", "Generators & Compressors", "Energy Management Control", "Airline Ground Support Equipment", "Industrial"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Fully automated CST machines", "Semi-automated machines", "Hot stamp printers", "Ink-jet printers", "Ultrasonic splicing equipment", "Ribbon cable notching and terminating equipment", "Cable testers", "High voltage testers"], "volume": "High-mix, low- and high-volume", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Strategic network of U.S. and Mexico facilities for diversified capacity", "20+ years of quotation and manufacturing engineering expertise per facility", "State-of-the-art manufacturing and testing equipment", "Highly trained and experienced labor force", "Superior front-end support from design to delivery"], "facts_used": ["Company name and former name -> /", "Location: Whitsett, Nort