UPDATE companies SET description='Idaho Hat Company was founded in 2003 in Nampa, Idaho, by a family with multi-generational experience in hat crafting, reshaping, and restoration. The shop operates from the front porch of the family home in downtown Nampa, serving the Treasure Valley region. Jorge, a key artisan, handles restoration and custom work.

The company produces many of the hats it sells in-house, while also carrying established brands such as Stetson, Resistol, American Hat Co., and Tony Lama boots. Services include hat shaping, cleaning, restoration, and custom hat and boot orders.

Customers range from local residents seeking everyday headwear to rodeo participants and fair-goers across the Treasure Valley. The shop also supports designers and artisans, and maintains a presence at community events. Prices start at $10, targeting both practical buyers and those looking for distinctive gifts.

The family-owned business emphasizes personalized service, community roots, and exclusive selections not found elsewhere. Its differentiation rests on decades of hands-on expertise, affordable pricing, and a commitment to building lasting relationships rather than one-time transactions.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Hat shaping", "Hat cleaning", "Hat restoration", "Custom hat manufacturing", "Custom boot manufacturing", "Retail sales of Western hats and boots", "Brand distribution (Stetson, Resistol, American Hat Co., Atwood, Austin Hat Co., Dorfman Hat Co., Laredo, Scala, SunBody, Tony Lama)", "Hat retail (felt, straw, palm leaf, leather)", "Accessories retail (belts, wallets, tack)"], "industries": ["Western apparel retail", "Rodeo and fair vendors", "Fashion accessories", "Gift retail"], "materials": ["Felt", "Straw", "Palm leaf", "Leather"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Established in 2003 with multi-generational hat-making heritage", "Family-owned shop located on the front porch of the family home", "In-house hat shaping, cleaning, and restoration services", "Custom hat and boot fabrication", "Exclusive brand selections including Stetson, Resistol, and Tony Lama"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2003 -> /, /about-us", "Location Nampa, Idaho -> /, /about-us", "Family-owned, multi-generational hat crafting -> /about-us", "Shop on front porch of family home -> /about-us", "Produces many hats sold in-house -> /about-us", "Carries brands Stetson, Resistol, American Hat Co., Tony Lama, etc. -> /about-us", "Services: hat shaping, cleaning, restoration, custom hat/boot orders -> /, /about-us", "Prices starting at $10 -> /about-us", "Community focus: designers/artisans, Treasure Valley fairs and rodeos -> /, /about-us", "Spanish language website -> /", "Jorge as restoration artisan -> /, /about-us", "Locally owned small business -> /", "Affordable prices, customer focused -> /"], "company_type":