nership directly with surgeons, entrepreneurs, and small to large orthopedic companies -> products array", "Fully cross compatible with industry standard (crossbars and Bridgeback) reamers -> industries_served array", "Design and development of medical devices from concept through manufacturing and release -> industries_served array", "Quality policy: meet or exceed customer, statutory, and regulatory requirements; pursue ever-improving quality -> /quality"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Incipio Devices is an orthopedic device company with offices in Huntington, Indiana and St-Blaise, Switzerland. The company was founded by industry experts wanting to provide solution-driven approaches to commercial products, contract manufacturing and development.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='incipio-devices' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='EMF Corporation was established in 1970 in Angola, Indiana, and operates four manufacturing facilities across Indiana, Kentucky, and Mississippi. The company serves customers nationwide and throughout North America from its Midwestern and Southern U.S. locations.

The company produces custom wire harnesses, discrete wire harnesses, injection-molded connectors, fluorescent lamp holders, lead wires, electronic cables, specialty connectors, receptacles, and junctions. Its capabilities include precision injection molding, custom electrical system engineering, prototyping, tooling, and full production runs. A sizable catalog of standard components supports custom assembly work, and the firm also manufactures electrical box builds, DC barrel connectors, extension cords, and shelf light harnesses.

EMF serves industries including retail, manufacturing, vending, refrigeration, lighting, electric motors, electrical controls, HVAC, automotive, and appliances.

