founded_year": "2000", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": ["https://www.linkedin.com/company/innosys-inc./"], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='innosys-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1994 in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, Innovative Electronics Corporation began as a provider of mechanical and electrical assembly solutions. The company operates as part of the Aragra Technologies group, which extends its capacity to offer a full range of manufacturing services from development through distribution.

The firm delivers electronic manufacturing services including surface-mount PCB assembly with BGA capability, semi-automated through-hole assembly, cable and wire harness fabrication, electro-mechanical assembly, box build, conformal coating, potting, and functional testing. It supports both turnkey and consignment models, with an integrated MRP system and KanBan programs, handling order volumes from ten pieces to over a thousand units.

