UPDATE companies SET description='Innovative Radiology is based in Conyers, Georgia, and was founded in 2016 by three industry colleagues—Josh Glas, Kyle Hall, and Chuck Luhrs—who identified a gap in the market for a dedicated supplier of GE radiography and fluoroscopy parts. The company operates with a team of 11 to 50 employees and maintains a warehouse in Gallatin, Tennessee.

