UPDATE companies SET description='Today ICC runs a 125,000-square-foot facility that designs, fabricates, and commissions custom control systems and power distribution equipment. Its product line includes UL 508A-certified relay control panels, control buildings and E-houses, skid-mounted solutions, and customized motor control centers. The shop holds UL 508, 508A, 698A, and 891 certifications alongside ISO 9001 and ISO 45001 registrations, and provides turnkey installation and calibration services that meet UL 508A safety standards.

