UPDATE companies SET description='Intertech Products, Inc. operates from North Manchester, Indiana, where it has built a reputation over more than three decades. The company traces its roots back 33 years, though a specific founding year and founder names are not disclosed in public materials. Ownership structure — whether family, veteran, woman, or employee-owned — is not stated.

