UPDATE companies SET description='Iron Works is a structural and miscellaneous steel fabricator and erector based in Milton, Delaware. Founded in 2003 by brothers Robert and John Klerlein, the family-owned business draws on over 70 years of combined experience between the two owners. The company began as a one-stop shop for steel construction projects in the region.

The shop handles simple to complex fabrication, including plate burning, and produces full steel packages such as stairs, rails, ladders, and ornamental metalwork. Annual output ranges from 1,800 to 2,400 tons of steel. The operation also provides complete steel erection services, delivering projects from start to finish.

Iron Works serves the construction industry, with completed projects including the Dogfish Head Brew Pub, the Grifasi Office Building, and the Movies at Midway Cube Theater.

