UPDATE companies SET description='J M Industries, based in North Billerica, Massachusetts, has been servicing semiconductor manufacturing equipment since its founding in 1982. The company began as a service and refurbishment operation for the machines it sells, and over four decades has built a reputation for keeping equipment operational long after original manufacturers discontinue support.

The company refurbishes and resells a broad range of semiconductor manufacturing equipment, including thermal shock chambers, mask aligners, wire bonders, ball bonders, probers, and reflow systems. It also specializes in rebuilding vacuum pumps, blowers, and dry pumps, offering a 2‑3 week turnaround on rebuilds. J M Industries maintains one of the largest and most diversified inventories of refurbished semiconductor equipment worldwide, with over 300 dual‑stage direct‑drive pumps in stock. Technicians perform upgrades such as touch‑screen retrofits for Mech‑el and MEI wire bonders and complete SST electronics rebuilds with a one‑year warranty.

The company supports equipment from brands such as Blue M, Technics, Perkin Elmer, Mechel, Karl Suss, Laurier, Ewald, Thermo/Neslab, YES, EG, Loomis, Mech‑el, and MEI. Its vacuum pump rebuilding service serves any operation relying on vacuum technology, while its equipment upgrades extend the life of legacy wire bonders and aligners.

J M Industries differentiates itself by offering long‑term support even after OEMs stop providing parts or service, and by not charging for equipment evaluations. The company contrasts its model with auctioneers and brokers, emphasizing that its refurbished machines come with a substantive warranty rather than a ''taillight'' guarantee, and that it avoids buyer premiums and forced carrier choices.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Vacuum pump rebuilding", "Blower rebuilding", "Dry pump rebuilding", "Semiconductor equipment refurbishment", "Touch screen upgrades", "SST upgrades and rebuilds", "Equipment testing and evaluation"], "industries": ["Semiconductor manufacturing"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["BLUE M WSP 109BC THERMAL SHOCK CHAMBER", "TECHNICS PEIIA UPGRADED", "PERKIN ELMER 4410", "MECHEL 827 BALL BONDER", "KARL SUSS MA 6 MASK ALIGNER", "LAURIER SA202", "EWALD GOLD TIN REFLOW SYSTEM", "Karl Suss MJB3 Aligner", "THERMO/NESLAB HX-300", "YES LP-III", "EG 2001CX PROBER", "Loomis Upgrade for LCD and LSD Series Scribers", "Mech-el 709", "Mech-el 703", "Mech-el 827", "Mech-el 829", "Mech-el 907", "Mech-el 908", "MEI 1204W", "MEI 1204B"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "2-3 weeks for vacuum pump rebuilding", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["No charge for equipment evaluation", "2\u20113 week guaranteed turnaround on vacuum pump rebuilding", "Over 300 dual\u2011stage direct\u2011drive pumps in stock", "Long\u2011term support after OEM end\u2011of\u2011life", "Refurbished equipment with substantive warranty (not just a taillight warranty)"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1982 -> db", "Headquarters in North Billerica, Massachusetts -> db", "Services semiconductor manufacturing equipment since 1982 -> /", "Refurbishes and tests machines before shipment -> /", "Provides long-term support after OEM support ends -> /", "No charge for evaluation -> /", "Offers touch screen upgrades for Mech-el and MEI wire bonders -> /", "Offers SST upgrades and rebuilds with 1-year warranty -> /", "Rebuilds vacuum pumps, blowers, and dry pumps with 2-3 week turnaround -> /", "Maintains over 300 dual-stage direct-drive pumps in stock -> /about", "Offers one of the largest and most diversified inventories of refurbished semiconductor equipment -> /about", "Compares favorably to auctioneers and brokers with substantive warranty -> /about"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "unclear", "type_evidence": "JM Industries offers one of the largest and most diversified inventories of Refurbished Semiconductor Manufacturing Equipment in the world.", "founded_year": "1982", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='j-m-industries' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
